    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Templar Macro guide  
Vicious Strike (R): Keep this basic skill in its default slot.
Pummel (T): Keep this in the T slot, but ensure it is always at the top of the priority list. (For example: If you add Annihilate to the T slot, set Annihilate to Slot 1 and Pummel to Slot 2 by default).
Num 1:  placing Poach in Slot 1 and Shield Rush in Slot 2.
How it works: Push → Eva → Shield Rush → Stun.
Num 2:
1 - Shield Smite
2 - Warding Strike
3 - Annihilate
4 - Judgment
Note: Since Judgment has a low cooldown, you can also consider placing it in the T slot.
Stigma &amp; CC 
Stigma Skills: You can place these freely in slots 5, 6, 7, or 8, as these skills are already very effective on their own.
CC Management: Templars have many CC (Crowd Control) abilities. I suggest using a Stun-Damage rotation—alternating between one CC skill and one high-damage skill—to maximize your total damage output.
Punishment: Since this is a Charge Skill,  mapping it to Q and triggering it manually based on the situation.
Example Combo: Poach → Stun → Punishment (CC the opponent to ensure the Charge Skill hits for maximum damage).</Description>
